PART 3  the graded obstruction map  Phi_j(A,B) = Jac(A,Q_m)+Jac(P_n,B)
   PREDICTION (proved in the artifact, a>=b):
       dim ker  Phi_j = max(0, m-j+1) + [g0 | j]
       dim coker Phi_j = (m-2) + [g0 | j]        for 1 <= j <= m
   where H = c*H0^d, g0 = deg H0.  The '+[g0|j]' is the ONLY free
